<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>prisma samples, live</title>
<meta name="description" content="Demos of the prisma renderer running in the browser on WebGL 2.">
<style>
:root { color-scheme: dark; --bg: #07070b; --panel: #0d0d14; --text: #f4f4f4; --muted: #b4b4c0; --line: #4a4a5c; --accent: #ff5fa2; }
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
.wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px 48px; }
h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 1.6rem; }
h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
.lead { color: var(--muted); max-width: 70ch; margin: 0 0 24px; }
.lead a { color: var(--accent); }
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.card { display: block; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; overflow: hidden; }
.card:hover, .card:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); }
.card img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; object-fit: cover; background: #000; }
.body { padding: 12px 14px 14px; }
.body h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
.body h2 span { color: var(--accent); }
.body p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; }
.note { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; margin-top: 28px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<h1><span>&gt;</span> prisma samples, live</h1>
<p class="lead">Demos of the <a href="https://github.com/akadjoker/prisma" rel="noopener">prisma</a> renderer running in your browser on WebGL 2. Each one is a small C++ program built with Emscripten; the source is in the <a href="https://github.com/akadjoker/prisma-samples" rel="noopener">prisma-samples</a> repository.</p>
<div class="grid">
@CARDS@
</div>
<p class="note">The demos that use compute, tessellation or geometry shaders need OpenGL 4.6 or Vulkan and run from the repository, not in the browser.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
